<ThingDefs><List>

	<!-- 衍天诀 · 终端法宝：共享素材库 -->
	<ThingDef Type="Item" Name="WFG_Item_HallMatFabao" Parent="MiBaoBase">
		<ThingName>灵析剑</ThingName>
		<TexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_item_lingxi_jian.png</TexPath>
		<FabaoTexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_fabao_lingxi_jian.png</FabaoTexPath>
		<Desc>衍天诀修士以自身素材库为引炼成的本命飞剑。佩之，个人素材库与衍天数据中心每秒自动双向并集同步：自己解析的素材会汇入总库，总库中他人所录之物也会补入个人库。唯修衍天诀者可用；卸下后，仅从总库借来的条目会自动移出，自己解析的素材保留。</Desc>
		<ElementKind>None</ElementKind>
		<Item Kind="Equipment">
			<PhysicalLables>
				<li>SmallThing</li>
				<li>GreatThing_Ling</li>
				<li>Smooth2</li>
				<li>Hard1</li>
			</PhysicalLables>
			<BeMade>
				<CostItems>
					<Item name="WFG_Item_YanTianZhu" count="3"/>
					<Item name="Item_LingStone" count="10"/>
				</CostItems>
			</BeMade>
			<Fabao>
				<ActiveCondition>
					<Condition eventid="Other" des="修行衍天诀" needcount="1"/>
				</ActiveCondition>
			</Fabao>
		</Item>
		<Element>
			<Kind>None</Kind>
		</Element>
	</ThingDef>

	<!-- 衍天诀 · 终端法宝：共享能源核心 -->
	<ThingDef Type="Item" Name="WFG_Item_HallEngFabao" Parent="MiBaoBase">
		<ThingName>灵源剑</ThingName>
		<TexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_item_lingyuan_jian.png</TexPath>
		<FabaoTexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_fabao_lingyuan_jian.png</FabaoTexPath>
		<Desc>以灵石为基、灵子为脉炼成的本命飞剑，与衍天能源中心同气连枝。佩之可把自身灵气存入总核心，亦可从中取用；取用方式可自行设定。唯修衍天诀者可用。</Desc>
		<ElementKind>None</ElementKind>
		<Item Kind="Equipment">
			<PhysicalLables>
				<li>SmallThing</li>
				<li>GreatThing_Ling</li>
				<li>Smooth2</li>
				<li>Hard1</li>
			</PhysicalLables>
			<BeMade>
				<CostItems>
					<Item name="WFG_Item_YanTianZhu" count="9"/>
					<Item name="Item_LingStone" count="100"/>
				</CostItems>
			</BeMade>
			<Fabao>
				<ActiveCondition>
					<Condition eventid="Other" des="修行衍天诀" needcount="1"/>
				</ActiveCondition>
			</Fabao>
		</Item>
		<Element>
			<Kind>None</Kind>
		</Element>
	</ThingDef>

	<!-- 衍天诀 · 第三柄本命飞剑：灵道剑（纳道行，剑威无上限） -->
	<ThingDef Type="Item" Name="WFG_Item_LingDaoJian" Parent="MiBaoBase">
		<ThingName>灵道剑</ThingName>
		<TexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_item_lingdao_jian.png</TexPath>
		<FabaoTexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_fabao_lingdao_jian.png</FabaoTexPath>
		<Desc>衍天诀修士以自身道行为锋铸成的本命飞剑。佩带并认主后，角色指令栏会多出「灵道剑」：可把自身道行存入剑中，也可随时取回。每存入 1 点道行，法宝威力加成 +1%，没有上限——存得越深，剑威越盛。该加成作用于佩者的全部法宝；代价是那些道行被剑占住，不能再用于修行。存道刻在修士自身而非剑上，换剑或易主不会带走道基；转修他法后加成失效，但仍可取回存道。唯修衍天诀者可炼可用。</Desc>
		<ElementKind>None</ElementKind>
		<Item Kind="Equipment">
			<PhysicalLables>
				<li>SmallThing</li>
				<li>Sharp</li>
				<li>Hard2</li>
				<li>GreatThing_Attack</li>
			</PhysicalLables>
			<BeMade>
				<CostItems>
					<Item name="WFG_Item_YanTianZhu" count="1"/>
					<Item name="Item_LingStone" count="49"/>
				</CostItems>
			</BeMade>
			<Fabao>
				<ActiveCondition>
					<Condition eventid="Other" des="修行衍天诀" needcount="1"/>
				</ActiveCondition>
			</Fabao>
		</Item>
		<Element>
			<Kind>None</Kind>
		</Element>
	</ThingDef>


	<!-- 衍天诀 · 凝练素材：衍天珠 -->
	<ThingDef Type="Item" Name="WFG_Item_YanTianZhu" Parent="DanBase">
		<ThingName>衍天珠</ThingName>
		<TexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_item_yantianzhu.png</TexPath>
		<Desc>衍天诀修士以自身灵气凝练而成的灵珠。服用可瞬间恢复一成最大灵气，并从根本上提高 25% 灵气上限（最多生效 4 次）；尚未入门的智慧生灵服用，还能增加筑基值。佩带可令心境 +100，并缓慢恢复伤势、气血与灵气。置于 5×5 范围内（游戏内「范围」显示为半径 2），聚灵效果与最顶级的聚灵物相当。它也是炼制灵析剑、灵源剑与灵道剑的核心材料，每颗需 500 灵气方能凝练。</Desc>
		<MaxStack>99</MaxStack>
		<Rate>12</Rate>
		<Beauty>25</Beauty>
		<ElementKind>None</ElementKind>
		<Item Lable="Dan">
			<Elixir>
				<ZhuJi>10000</ZhuJi>
				<Modifier>WFG_Mod_YanTian_ZhuUse</Modifier>
			</Elixir>
			<Equip>
				<ToolModifier>WFG_Mod_YanTian_ZhuEquip</ToolModifier>
			</Equip>
		</Item>
		<Ling>
			<AddionLing>200</AddionLing>
			<AddionRadius>2</AddionRadius>
			<AddionFailing>0.95</AddionFailing>
			<AddionFailRadius>1</AddionFailRadius>
			<Attenuation>0.1</Attenuation>
			<Absorption>0.8</Absorption>
			<Accommodate>40</Accommodate>
		</Ling>
		<Element>
			<Kind>None</Kind>
			<Value>0</Value>
		</Element>
	</ThingDef>

	<!-- 衍天诀 · 衍天佩（手工台装备，按已学技能解锁增幅） -->
	<ThingDef Type="Item" Name="WFG_Item_YanTianPei" Parent="ToolBase">
		<ThingName>衍天佩</ThingName>
		<TexPath>Spr\Object\wfg_item_yantianpei.png</TexPath>
		<Desc>衍天诀修士以衍天珠为核、灵木为匣炼成的护身玉佩。佩戴后，已学的衍天诀技能会逐项解锁对应增幅：总纲、自愈、精研、避天机、御剑、灵盾、器谱、周天、锋锐、不灭的原有效果各翻一倍；解析/创造耗灵减半；本命法宝节点原本只解锁配方，佩版额外给 +100% 法宝威力；炼石解锁主动神通「衍天·炼石（佩）」，点击后每 10 秒一枚。未学会的技能不生效；卸下后所有加成消失。手工台制作：1 衍天珠 + 10 任意木料。</Desc>
		<MaxStack>1</MaxStack>
		<Rate>1</Rate>
		<Beauty>15</Beauty>
		<ElementKind>None</ElementKind>
		<Item Lable="Tool" Kind="Equipment">
			<BeMade>
				<WorkToMake>300</WorkToMake>
				<Quality>0</Quality>
				<StuffCategories>
					<Stuff name="Wood"/>
					<Stuff name="WoodBlock"/>
				</StuffCategories>
				<CostStuffCount>10</CostStuffCount>
				<CostItems>
					<Item name="WFG_Item_YanTianZhu" count="1"/>
				</CostItems>
			</BeMade>
		</Item>
		<ProduceMode>
			<ProduceBuildings>
				<li>
					<Building>HandWorkTable</Building>
					<Count>1</Count>
				</li>
			</ProduceBuildings>
		</ProduceMode>
		<Element>
			<Kind>None</Kind>
		</Element>
	</ThingDef>
</List></ThingDefs>
